sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Client
    participant API as FastAPI<br/>/tenants/{id}/documents
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant Disk as uploads/<br/>filesystem
    participant Celery as leasegenie.<br/>index_document task
    participant OCR as OCR service<br/>pdfplumber + Tesseract
    participant Embed as Ollama<br/>nomic-embed-text
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB<br/>(persistent)

    User->>+API: POST /tenants/TENANT_ID/documents<br/>multipart file + document_type + effective_date
    API->>API: Validate: base_lease first,<br/>max 7 amendments
    API->>+Disk: Write PDF →<br/>uploads/TENANT_ID/NN_filename.pdf
    Disk-->>-API: saved
    API->>+DB: INSERT Document<br/>ocr_status=pending
    DB-->>-API: doc_id
    API->>+Celery: index_document_task.delay(doc_id)
    Celery-->>-API: queued
    API-->>-User: 201 Created<br/>{doc_id, ocr_status: pending}

    Note over Celery,Chroma: Asynchronous indexing begins

    Celery->>+DB: SELECT Document<br/>by doc_id
    DB-->>-Celery: row
    Celery->>+Chroma: has_document(tenant_id, doc_id)?
    Chroma-->>-Celery: false (new)
    Celery->>DB: UPDATE ocr_status=ocr_in_progress

    Celery->>+OCR: extract_document_text(pdf_path)
    OCR->>OCR: pdfplumber per page<br/>Tesseract fallback if <30 chars
    OCR-->>-Celery: DocumentText(pages)

    Celery->>+OCR: segment_clauses(doc_text)
    OCR->>OCR: Regex: numbered / Section /<br/>ALL-CAPS headings
    OCR-->>-Celery: list[Clause]

    loop batched by 32 clauses
        Celery->>+Embed: POST /api/embeddings<br/>{model: nomic-embed-text, prompt: text}
        Embed-->>-Celery: 768-dim vector
        Celery->>+Chroma: upsert(ids, documents,<br/>embeddings, metadatas)
        Note over Chroma: metadata: tenant_id, doc_id,<br/>doc_label, page, clause, heading
        Chroma-->>-Celery: ok
    end

    Celery->>DB: UPDATE ocr_status=indexed
    Note over Celery: Document is now searchable<br/>via semantic_search tool

    Note over User,API: Later — client polls status
    User->>+API: GET /tenants/TENANT_ID/documents
    API->>+DB: SELECT Documents
    DB-->>-API: rows with ocr_status
    API-->>-User: [{ocr_status: indexed, ...}]
